17:T4ee,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is the Germany blocked account for students in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The official study-visa guidance lists at least €11,904 for 2026 for the standard twelve-month route. Verify the current amount for your purpose and responsible mission before transferring money."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a blocked account the only proof of financing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Official guidance also describes recognised scholarships, declarations of commitment and other accepted routes. The responsible mission decides what applies to the case."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I complete the entire visa process online?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Consular Services Portal supports online submission and preliminary checks, but an in-person appointment can still be required for originals, biometrics and the fee."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does university admission guarantee the student visa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Admission supports the study purpose, while the visa authority separately assesses the complete application and applicable requirements."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"$undefined","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/germany-student-visa-requirements/\",\"name\":\"Germany student visa requirements and document checklist\",\"description\":\"Plan your Germany student visa file: admission evidence, financing, insurance and the responsible mission’s checklist. Keep visa and university deadlines separate.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/germany-student-visa-requirements/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-08\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-21\",\"primary